\frac{a(b-1)}{1-b}&>0\Rightarrow \\
\frac{a(1-b)}{1-b}&>0\Rightarrow\\
a&>0.
\end{align*}We note that $a, b \> 0$, so we do not actually need to get to this point for this problem.

